<title>USA: DHS Industries to buy market research firm.</title>
<headline>DHS Industries to buy market research firm.</headline>
<dateline>ENCINO, Calif. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>DHS Industries Inc said Wednesday it had signed an agreement in principle to acquire an unnamed marketing research company.</p>
<p>The terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>DHS said the acquisition would add about $600,000 in revenues and $125,000 in net profit to its annual results. DHS had revenues of $247,000 through the six months ended June 30.</p>
<p>DHS is a marketing research firm.</p>
